  </data>
  <data name="WarningText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A tunnel only changes network transport - it does not replace passkey pairing/sign-in. An unauthenticated request arriving over the tunnel still cannot reach any data. Starting a tunnel makes this server reachable from the internet, so it requires a fresh passkey confirmation (step-up) even in an already-signed-in session.</value>
